  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian adviser secondees to the European Community Humanitarian Office (ECHO) for policy advocacy, donor coordination, and cross-border work on refugee matters.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Humanitarian adviser secondees to the European Community Humanitarian Office (ECHO) for policy advocacy, donor coordination, and cross-border work on refugee matters. is a component of Support for Protection and Assistance of Refugees in Kenya (SPARK)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;117,976. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
  </description>
